    example: "When critics complained about Jesus eating with sinners, he twice quoted Hosea 6:6, ‘I desire mercy, and not sacrifice’ (Matthew 9:13; Matthew 12:7). He used the love principle to interpret the rules about purity and Sabbath. The command served people; people were not sacrificed to the command.",
